  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "GET and HEAD requests need to be able to supply a Want-Digest header. See the link below for syntax.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "To support this, there should also be a \"Cache-Control: no-cache\" option, as recommended by the specification",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "See:",
       "type": "text"
      },
