  "description": "<p>GET and HEAD requests need to be able to supply a Want-Digest header. See the link below for syntax.</p>\n\n<p>To support this, there should also be a \"Cache-Control: no-cache\" option, as recommended by the specification</p>\n\n<p>See:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#http-get-ldpnr\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#http-get-ldpnr</a> <br/>\n<a href=\"https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3230#section-4.3.1\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3230#section-4.3.1</a></p>",
